We additionally provide a Zenodo archival repository with the following:

(1) the SCREAM v1 code;
(2) the default E3SM v3 code for E3SM-MAM runs;
(3) the modified E3SM v3 code for E3SM-SPA runs;
(4) the code to reproduce the plots in the manuscripts;
(5) instructions to reproduce the runs in the manuscript;
(6) instructions to retrieve the data files from runs.

The the following subfolders correspond to the items above, in order:

01_scream-v1_code
02_e3sm-mam_code
03_e3sm-spa_code
04_plots
05_runs
06_archive
